    <script type="application/ld+json">
      {"@context":"http://schema.org","@graph":[{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"FeedOps","url":"https://au.linkedin.com/company/feedops"},"datePublished":"2026-05-22T00:43:33.844Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/feedops_googles-shopping-graph-indexes-60b-products-activity-7463389055360065536-iv0B","text":"Most ecommerce teams still treat their product feed as a Merchant Center compliance task.\n\nGet the products approved.\nFix the errors.\nKeep the feed live.\nMove on.\n\nBut Google’s Shopping Graph has changed the role of product data.\nIt now helps power Shopping Ads, free listings, AI Overviews, AI Mode, Gemini, and other AI-led shopping experiences. That means product data is no longer just a feed. It is a visibility layer.\n\nIf your product titles are generic, your attributes are missing, your categories are shallow, or your price and availability data is stale, Google has less context to work with.\n\nThat matters. Because AI shopping experiences rely on structured product data to understand:\n• What the product is\n • Who it is for\n • Which searches it matches\n • Whether the data can be trusted\n • Whether the product should be shown\n\nMerchant Center approval is now the floor. The real opportunity is helping Google understand your products better.\n\nRead the full guide here: https://lnkd.in/gPgrnm48\n\n#googleshopping #pmax\n","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/feedops_googles-shopping-graph-indexes-60b-products-activity-7463389055360065536-iv0B"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"FeedOps","url":"https://au.linkedin.com/company/feedops"},"datePublished":"2025-10-20T23:26:16.179Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/feedops_this-award-reflects-our-shared-vision-with-activity-7386180988260950016-EmVl","text":"This award reflects our shared vision with Microsoft Advertising — using AI to make ecommerce advertising smarter, simpler, and more effective.","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/feedops_this-award-reflects-our-shared-vision-with-activity-7386180988260950016-EmVl"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"FeedOps","url":"https://au.linkedin.com/company/feedops"},"datePublished":"2025-10-01T05:48:47.027Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/feedops_chatgpt-ecommerce-feedops-activity-7379029493744771072-rHUG","text":"🚀 ChatGPT Shopping Search Is Here — Are Your Product Feeds Ready?\n\nOpenAI just launched ChatGPT Shopping Search\n — a new way for customers to discover and buy products directly inside ChatGPT.\n\nFor now, Instant Checkout is only available in the U.S., but the direction is clear:\n\n 🧠 Conversational commerce is coming fast.\n 🛍️ Structured product data is the new storefront.\n\nAt FeedOps, we’re already helping merchants get their product feeds ready for this new channel — optimizing titles, filling missing attributes, and aligning data to OpenAI’s commerce feed spec\n.\nIf you want your products to show up in ChatGPT Shopping Search, it starts with your feed. Our team can help you prepare, optimize, and be ready to plug in when access expands globally.\n\n📚 Read our latest post:  https://lnkd.in/gDejEgTX\n#ChatGPT #Ecommerce #FeedOps #AI #ProductFeeds #ShoppingAds #OpenAI #DigitalCommerce","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/feedops_chatgpt-ecommerce-feedops-activity-7379029493744771072-rHUG"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"FeedOps","url":"https://au.linkedin.com/company/feedops"},"datePublished":"2025-08-29T01:26:19.385Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/feedops_nora-partner-showcase-with-frank-grasso-of-activity-7367004643798773762-uKTs","text":"Great conversation between our CEO Frank Grasso and Shaeden Watson from NORA ~ National Online Retailers Association\n\nThey explored:\n\nThe role of product data in driving growth.\nThe challenges agencies and retailers face with Shopping and PMax.\nHow smarter feed optimization can reduce wasted spend and improve ROAS.\nA valuable watch for anyone looking to unlock more from their ad campaigns.\n\nhttps://lnkd.in/gpYK2Y8e","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/feedops_nora-partner-showcase-with-frank-grasso-of-activity-7367004643798773762-uKTs"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"FeedOps","url":"https://au.linkedin.com/company/feedops"},"datePublished":"2025-08-26T04:24:16.988Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/feedops_google-shopping-feed-optimization-guide-2025-activity-7365962265319178241-G_a8","text":"A smarter way to optimize Google Shopping feeds is here.\n\nWe’ve completely updated our Google Shopping Feed Optimization Guide to reflect the latest best practices — and we’ve added how AI can be used to take your feed further.\n\nFrom fixing common feed issues to enhancing product titles and attributes, this guide gives eCommerce teams and agencies a practical playbook for increasing visibility, clicks, and conversions.\n\nRead the updated guide here: https://lnkd.in/gtm4TmAS\n #Ecommerce #GoogleShopping #ProductFeeds #AIOptimization","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/feedops_google-shopping-feed-optimization-guide-2025-activity-7365962265319178241-G_a8"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"FeedOps","url":"https://au.linkedin.com/company/feedops"},"datePublished":"2025-08-25T03:03:36.317Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/feedops_amazonsellersummit-ecommerce-feedoptimization-activity-7365579574245588994-RCwD","text":"🚀 Big news from FeedOps: We’re sponsoring the Amazon Australia Seller Summit 2025 and officially launching our new Marketplace Solution — bringing AI-powered feed optimization to every marketplace.\nThis annual, in-person event is Amazon’s biggest gathering for sellers in Australia. Expect inspiration from Amazon leaders, practical tips for growth, and the chance to connect with other sellers and service providers.\nIf you’re looking to expand your eCommerce business, this is the event you won’t want to miss.\n\nhttps://lnkd.in/gQ8JT4hc\n\n📍 When & Where: Tuesday, 2 September 2025 | ICC Sydney\n 🎟️ Register now for free\n\n#AmazonSellerSummit #Ecommerce #FeedOptimization #MarketplaceGrowth #FeedOps","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/feedops_amazonsellersummit-ecommerce-feedoptimization-activity-7365579574245588994-RCwD"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"FeedOps","url":"https://au.linkedin.com/company/feedops"},"datePublished":"2025-08-19T04:42:05.347Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/feedops_httpslnkdingpybqyg4-activity-7363430031303331840-PrQk","text":"https://lnkd.in/gpYbqYg4","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/feedops_httpslnkdingpybqyg4-activity-7363430031303331840-PrQk"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"Organization","name":"FeedOps","url":"https://au.linkedin.com/company/feedops","address":{"type":"PostalAddress","addressLocality":"Adelaide","postalCode":"5000","addressCountry":"AU"},"description":"FeedOps helps ecommerce brands and agencies optimize product data for better ad performance.\n\nWhether you're running Google Shopping, PMax, Meta Ads, or scaling across Microsoft, Amazon, and other marketplaces — FeedOps connects, audits, and improves your product feed to align with campaign goals.\n\n✅ Built for ROAS\n✅ Trusted by retailers\n✅ Loved by agencies\n\nOur platform combines AI-powered feed optimization with expert strategy to reduce wasted spend, unlock more sales, and keep your ad dollars focused on high-intent clicks.\n\nFix your product data. Align it to your ad strategy. Get better results.\n\n→ Want a free feed audit? DM us \"AUDIT\" to get started.\n\n","numberOfEmployees":{"value":6,"@type":"QuantitativeValue"},"logo":{"contentUrl":"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D560BAQGIgnfcfsc_Hg/company-logo_200_200/company-logo_200_200/0/1680305952166/feedops_logo?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=jfgCswnYzXXOy3W9uxQ-UrCp-OYgVgHyuaU_gkRFhQA","description":"FeedOps","@type":"ImageObject"},"slogan":"Shopping Feed Optimization for Google, Microsoft, Meta & Marketplaces — Built for ROAS. Powered by Product Data.","sameAs":"http://www.feedops.com"}]}
    </script>
  
  
      
