  <div class="attributed-text-segment-list__container relative mt-1 mb-1.5 babybear:mt-0 babybear:mb-0.5">
    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">More than 70% of <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fai&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#AI</a> retail search results now include pricing, product cards and direct purchase links.

AI platforms are no longer just used for research. They are making purchasing decisions for your customers, and will soon become the checkout.

We are now 2 weeks out from the <a class="link" href="https://au.linkedin.com/company/jaywingaustralia?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Jaywing Australia</a> and <a class="link" href="https://au.linkedin.com/company/feedops?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>FeedOps</a> Agentic Commerce event, From Prompt to Purchase, in Sydney.

Hear from Jaywing's Head of SEO &amp; GEO <a class="link" href="https://au.linkedin.com/in/rhilborn?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Rob Hilborn</a>, Ecommerce Director <a class="link" href="https://au.linkedin.com/in/ash-terry-19b91597?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Ash Terry</a> and Founder &amp; CEO of FeedOps <a class="link" href="https://au.linkedin.com/in/frank-grasso?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Frank Grasso</a> who will be covering the shift in search and buying behaviour, how to gain visibility on AI platforms, and what metrics now matter to measure performance.

Join us on Thursday the 30th if April, 3-7pm. 
Alpha, The Gallery, Level 1, 238 Castlereagh St, Sydney CBD.

Free registration link in the comments below.</p>
