  <div class="attributed-text-segment-list__container relative mt-1 mb-1.5 babybear:mt-0 babybear:mb-0.5">
    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="feed-reshare-content__commentary">Thrilled to share that FeedOps has been named the 2025 Microsoft Advertising APAC Winner for AI Innovation.

This award celebrates how partners are using Microsoft’s AI solutions to transform industries — and for us, it recognises the work our team has done to help ecommerce retailers and agencies drive better results through smarter product data and AI automation.

A huge thank you to <a class="link" href="https://au.linkedin.com/in/paulckorber?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Paul Korber</a>, <a class="link" href="https://au.linkedin.com/in/kenji-n-701b1012?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Kenji N.</a> and <a class="link" href="https://au.linkedin.com/in/reneestopps?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Renee Stopps</a> from the <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/showcase/microsoft-advertising/?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Microsoft Advertising</a> team for your partnership, guidance, and ongoing support — it’s been incredible working with you.

Congratulations to all the 2025 APAC winners: <a class="link" href="https://au.linkedin.com/company/feedops?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>FeedOps</a> (thats us), <a class="link" href="https://jp.linkedin.com/company/cyberagent?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>CyberAgent, Inc.</a>| <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/adpulseinc?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Adpulse</a> (congrats <a class="link" href="https://au.linkedin.com/in/shbond?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Shaun Bond</a>) | <a class="link" href="https://jp.linkedin.com/company/transcosmos-inc-?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>transcosmos inc.</a> | <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/company/dentsu?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>dentsu</a> Singapore | <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/hilton-hotels-and-resorts-brand?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Hilton Hotels &amp; Resorts</a> | <a class="link" href="https://in.linkedin.com/company/simprosys?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Simprosys InfoMedia</a> | <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/sparro-digital?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Sparro</a> by <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/brainlabs-digital?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Brainlabs</a> | <a class="link" href="https://au.linkedin.com/company/temple-&amp;-webster?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Temple &amp; Webster</a> | Dentsu Digital Inc. | <a class="link" href="https://au.linkedin.com/company/wavemaker-anz?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Wavemaker Australia &amp; New Zealand</a> | <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/audible?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Audible</a> | <a class="link" href="https://jp.linkedin.com/company/hakuhodo-dy-one?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Hakuhodo DY ONE Inc.</a> | <a class="link" href="https://jp.linkedin.com/company/wacul?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>株式会社WACUL</a>

The level of innovation across this partner community is inspiring — we’re proud to be part of it.

