  <div class="attributed-text-segment-list__container relative mt-1 mb-1.5 babybear:mt-0 babybear:mb-0.5">
    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        attributed-text-segment-list__content-truncated" dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">Great conversation between our CEO <a class="link" href="https://au.linkedin.com/in/frank-grasso?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Frank Grasso</a> and <a class="link" href="https://au.linkedin.com/in/shaeden-watson?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Shaeden Watson</a> from <a class="link" href="https://au.linkedin.com/company/national-online-retailers-association?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>NORA ~ National Online Retailers Association</a>

They explored:

The role of product data in driving growth.
The challenges agencies and retailers face with Shopping and PMax.
How smarter feed optimization can reduce wasted spend and improve ROAS.
A valuable watch for anyone looking to unlock more from their ad campaigns.

