        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">A smarter way to optimize Google Shopping feeds is here.

We’ve completely updated our Google Shopping Feed Optimization Guide to reflect the latest best practices — and we’ve added how AI can be used to take your feed further.

From fixing common feed issues to enhancing product titles and attributes, this guide gives eCommerce teams and agencies a practical playbook for increasing visibility, clicks, and conversions.

