    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">🚀 Big news from FeedOps: We’re sponsoring the Amazon Australia Seller Summit 2025 and officially launching our new Marketplace Solution — bringing AI-powered feed optimization to every marketplace.
This annual, in-person event is Amazon’s biggest gathering for sellers in Australia. Expect inspiration from Amazon leaders, practical tips for growth, and the chance to connect with other sellers and service providers.
If you’re looking to expand your eCommerce business, this is the event you won’t want to miss.

